ho was wearing a sash with the French tricolour, was seen collapsed on the side of the car after the attack but did not need hospital care. Read moreUS journalist injured during ","Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:58:07 GMT",https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261017-israeli-settlers-attack-european-delegation-convoy-in-west-bank-beat-french-mayor,2026-10-18 01:45:57
France 24 (EN),Western Europe,en,"France: ""We've seen extremely high tensions between protesters and law enforcement""","France: ""We've seen extremely high tensions between protesters and law enforcement""","France: ""We've seen extremely high tensions between protesters and law enforcement"" Protesters across France called for street demonstrations on Saturday against rising living costs. France 24's Antonia Kerrigan reports from Paris.

