versees humanitarian affairs in Gaza. The suspension is raising fears about affordability, with humanitarian workers","Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:58:35 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/commercial-goods-are-no-longer-entering-gaza-raising-fears-of-worsening-shortages-in-the-territory/article71589618.ece,2026-10-18 01:49:29
