The Hindu,South Asia,en,Why is Spain facing a housing crisis? | Explained,Why is Spain facing a housing crisis? | Explained,"Why is Spain facing a housing crisis? | Explained How are tourism and investment funds worsening the crisis? Why is Spain struggling to provide affordable housing? How has the housing crisis affected Sánchez’s government? What measures has the government proposed to tackle the crisis? What is at stake in Spain’s snap election? You are logged in Loading... You don’t have any Active Subscription. Subscribed with another email? Logout and Login with that one. Your active subscription(s) Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Products you've access to Additional Subscription Benefits Account Settings Need help with your subscription? Updated- October 18, 2026 01:12 am IST People take part in a protest demanding action to alleviate Spain’s housing crisis in Barcelona on October 9 | Photo Credit: REUTERS The story so far: Last month, 87-year-old María del Carmen Abascal was evicted from her home of over seven decades. Her father first rented Abascal’s apartment in Madrid’s upscale Retiro neighbourhood in 1956. She stayed there under rent control after her parents died. The building changed ownership in 2018, and Abascal was offered the option to buy the unit. Since she couldn’t afford it, investment fund Urbagestión bought the unit and raised the rent from 500 euros to 2,650 euros. The fund then lowered the rent to 1,650 euros, but Abascal, who was living on pension funds, still could not afford it. Her eviction sparked tens of thousands of people to protest nationwide over a housing crisis that is crippling the European nation. Hundreds of people set up tents in Madrid’s Puerta del Sol plaza, with some camping out there for over a week. They are demanding stronger protections for tenants, lower rents and a ban on investment ","Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:12:16 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/why-is-spain-facing-a-housing-crisis-explained/article71583583.ece,2026-10-18 01:49:33
